ches to a built-in backup tracer if the game's engine ever fails to load, so your lines never vanish.\n\n• Full Cue Ball Path — Shows exactly where the cue ball will roll, including up to 3 cushion bounces.\n\n• Target Ball Lines — See where the ball you hit is heading, along with its own bank bounces and deflections.\n\n• Pocket & Scratch Alerts — Turns into a ring marker when a ball is going in, and warns you in bright red if the cue ball is about to scratch.\n\n• Bank Shot Markers — Clean rings show the exact spot a ball will bounce off the cushions.\n\n• Combo & Double Hits — Predicts chain reactions so you can plan combo shots and see secondary collisions.\n\n• Real Ball Colors — Every guideline uses the matching color of the ball you're aiming at, so the table stays easy to read.\n\n• Resting Spots — Shows ghost circles right where each ball will finally stop moving on the table.\n\n• Stripe & Solid Identifiers — Ghost markers for balls 9 to 15 have stripe bands on them, making it easy to spot your targets at a glance.","tags":["prediction lines","bank shot","cue ball path","pocket alerts","roblox scripts"],"discord":"","keyLink":"https://jnkie.com/get-key/s-gag8ballmovement","owner":{"_id":"64cf27925d535051bf07f623","username":"Succuh","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/da9f87dea96345d99e1b10c073dd31844cf74e27ac2da534f45a52af0010aa2e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/64cf27925d535051bf07f623-1791685874106.jpg"},"lvl":10,"status":"offline","id":"64cf27925d535051bf07f623","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/da9f87dea96345d99e1b10c073dd31844cf74e27ac2da534f45a52af0010aa2e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/64cf27925d535051bf07f623-1791685874106.jpg"}},"reviewed":{"name":"QueueSpeedDemon","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-10-08T12:21:32.503Z","profile":"/u/QueueSpeedDemon"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{